; Microbenchmarks of the 3D builtins: entities and their movement, transforms, appearance, meshes and surfaces, textures, brushes,
; cameras, picks, collisions and RenderWorld. See micro.bi for how a case is timed; python3 benchmarks/micro.py builds and runs it.
;
; Runs with BlitzLLVM and with the original Blitz3D: what differs between them is in bench_llvm.bi and bench_original.bi, which the
; runner copies next to this file as bench_compiler.bi.
Include "bench_compiler.bi"
Include "bench_begin.bi"
